## Wave crest building blocks for the bar-graph wave animations.
## Each tube is a center-column bar at one of five levels:
##   b0 blank, b1 bottom dash, b2 +lower-center, b3 +full center, b4 +top cap.
sprite|b0|0x0000
sprite|b1|0x0008
sprite|b2|0x0808
sprite|b3|0x0888
sprite|b4|0x0889

## A crest_N segment is a triangular swell rising to peak N and back down,
## one bar wider on each side per level. Compose a wave by laying crests out
## with b0 troughs between them.
segment|crest_1|{b1}
segment|crest_2|{b1}{b2}{b1}
segment|crest_3|{b1}{b2}{b3}{b2}{b1}
segment|crest_4|{b1}{b2}{b3}{b4}{b3}{b2}{b1}
